        <cm:mimedesc cm:id="iKNgXXtGx_-gXK9yk" cm:mimetype="text/html" cm:encoding="utf-8">&lt;p&gt;Optional Feature.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Debug capapbility can be added to application. This allows you to easier search for bugs and remove them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Debug capability is not usefull for the end user, so you can remove it from your product.&lt;/p&gt;</cm:mimedesc>
